{"id":"51696a3513b66fda","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-dtm-local-transition.md","title":"One Turing-Machine Step","display":"df-turing-machine-step — One Turing-Machine Step","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-dtm-local-transition","aliases":["73-df-dtm-local-transition","73-df-turing-machine-step"],"display":"df-turing-machine-step — One Turing-Machine Step","depends_on":["[[73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-dtm-local-transition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-dtm-local-transition</span><span>73-df-turing-machine-step</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-machine-step — One Turing-Machine Step"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8dd5a913cb2152a3\" href=\"?note=8dd5a913cb2152a3\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations\">73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (single-tape DTM)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\)</span> (configuration set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8dd5a913cb2152a3\" href=\"?note=8dd5a913cb2152a3\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations\">73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\">\\(T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h,i\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(h,i\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Gamma\">\\(a\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；写带函数只在这些类型上定义。转移子句的两个配置属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\)</span>，方向函数的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}step}\\vdash\nd(\\mathsf L)\\coloneqq-1,\\qquad d(\\mathsf R)\\coloneqq 1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}step}\\vdash\nd(\\mathsf L)\\coloneqq-1,\\qquad d(\\mathsf R)\\coloneqq 1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}step}\\vdash\nT[h\\mapsto a](i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\na,&amp;i=h,\\\\\nT(i),&amp;i\\neq h\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}step}\\vdash\nT[h\\mapsto a](i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\na,&amp;i=h,\\\\\nT(i),&amp;i\\neq h\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}step}\\vdash\n(q,T,h)\\to_M(q&#39;,T&#39;,h&#39;)\\leftrightarrow\n(q,T,h),(q&#39;,T&#39;,h&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\n\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\n\\land\\exists a\\in\\Gamma\\,\\exists D\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\;\n\\bigl(((q,T(h)),(q&#39;,a,D))\\in\\delta\\land\nT&#39;=T[h\\mapsto a]\\land h&#39;=h+d(D)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}step}\\vdash\n(q,T,h)\\to_M(q&#39;,T&#39;,h&#39;)\\leftrightarrow\n(q,T,h),(q&#39;,T&#39;,h&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\n\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\n\\land\\exists a\\in\\Gamma\\,\\exists D\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\;\n\\bigl(((q,T(h)),(q&#39;,a,D))\\in\\delta\\land\nT&#39;=T[h\\mapsto a]\\land h&#39;=h+d(D)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A step simultaneously changes state, overwrites the scanned cell, and moves the head once; halting states have no outgoing step.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations","status":"resolved","id":"8dd5a913cb2152a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations","status":"resolved","id":"8dd5a913cb2152a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Conf}_M$ (configuration set, see [[73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}_M","display":false},{"tex":"T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"h,i\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}step}\\vdash\nd(\\mathsf L)\\coloneqq-1,\\qquad d(\\mathsf R)\\coloneqq 1","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}step}\\vdash\nT[h\\mapsto a](i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\na,&i=h,\\\\\nT(i),&i\\neq h\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}step}\\vdash\n(q,T,h)\\to_M(q',T',h')\\leftrightarrow\n(q,T,h),(q',T',h')\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\n\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\n\\land\\exists a\\in\\Gamma\\,\\exists D\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\;\n\\bigl(((q,T(h)),(q',a,D))\\in\\delta\\land\nT'=T[h\\mapsto a]\\land h'=h+d(D)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1602,"backlinks":[{"id":"8630ed136c8dde2d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\to_M$ (one-step relation, see [[73-df-dtm-local-transition]])"},{"id":"9fa7db79fea5f29a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$d(\\mathsf L)=-1$ and $d(\\mathsf R)=1$ (head displacements, see [[73-df-dtm-local-transition]])"},{"id":"2f2ad13d4f8c1f98","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$d(\\mathsf L)=-1$ and $d(\\mathsf R)=1$ (head displacements, see [[73-df-dtm-local-transition]])"},{"id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}$；$B\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*$；方向符号、位移 $d$ 和带更新见 [[73-df-dtm-local-transition]]；$\\operatorname{RTC}$ 见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。"},{"id":"ab975c5a8c0c0424","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{sgn}$ 是只作用于方向符号 $\\{L,R\\}$ 的位移函数；$T[h\\mapsto a]$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-local-transition]]。"}],"outgoing":["8dd5a913cb2152a3"]}